# Back into the museum by night without the fade, LbaWinSettings: 194
# (fixtures/nofadedark). Up as the save loads walks Twinsen out into
# scene 42, and Down walks him back through the side door into the
# museum, whose script sets its dark palette as the scene comes in:
# the museum's first frame shows in that palette, which FlagPal keeps.

hold 0.05
sleep 40
key Down Return
sleep 3
key Return
sleep 0.3
down Up
sleep 1.8
up Up
shot out
sleep 2
shot street
down Down
sleep 2
up Down
shot back
sleep 2
shot museum
